1
00:00:01,376 --> 00:00:02,376
What now?

2
00:00:02,413 --> 00:00:04,577
How can I escape
the bullying?

3
00:00:06,142 --> 00:00:07,142
This is hopeless

4
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:10,262
And I can't believe
I'm sitting

5
00:00:10,345 --> 00:00:11,780
with Kim Hyeong-ju

6
00:00:12,873 --> 00:00:14,546
Am I an idiot or what?

7
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:16,645
I shouldn't have
done that

8
00:00:17,679 --> 00:00:19,465
Right, I'll pretend
like I'm asleep

9
00:00:20,162 --> 00:00:21,555
That's
the best strategy

10
00:00:21,638 --> 00:00:22,718
They won't bother me
as much

11
00:00:23,307 --> 00:00:25,199
I'm sure
they won't wake me up

12
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:31,155
What the heck?

13
00:00:31,435 --> 00:00:32,710
Did I actually
fall asleep?

14
00:00:33,648 --> 00:00:35,036
We're not there yet

15
00:00:35,443 --> 00:00:36,993
But why is it so cramped?

16
00:00:45,629 --> 00:00:47,390
What the hell?
This isn't like him

17
00:00:48,015 --> 00:00:49,215
Why is he
suddenly acting nice?

18
00:01:03,814 --> 00:01:04,969
What's going on?

19
00:01:05,579 --> 00:01:06,579
Ever since
the school trip

20
00:01:07,459 --> 00:01:09,184
Hyeon-wu is sending
weird signs

21
00:01:12,114 --> 00:01:13,866
What the hell?
It's so creepy

22
00:01:15,048 --> 00:01:16,632
Il-tak, my favorite doll

23
00:01:17,953 --> 00:01:19,162
Get over here

24
00:01:25,586 --> 00:01:27,559
Just ignore them

25
00:01:27,642 --> 00:01:28,443
What?

26
00:01:28,526 --> 00:01:31,300
He's never stood up
for me like this

27
00:01:31,383 --> 00:01:32,383
Hong Il-tak

28
00:01:32,827 --> 00:01:34,720
Didn't I tell you
to get over here?

29
00:01:34,803 --> 00:01:35,853
Are you crazy?

30
00:01:38,622 --> 00:01:39,622
Just a second

31
00:01:40,125 --> 00:01:41,125
Hey!

32
00:01:41,602 --> 00:01:42,602
Listen up

33
00:01:45,410 --> 00:01:48,378
I'll kill anyone
who bothers

34
00:01:48,461 --> 00:01:49,735
Hong Il-tak from now on

35
00:01:51,176 --> 00:01:52,176
So, stop it

36
00:01:53,218 --> 00:01:54,298
Especially you
Kim Hyeong-ju

37
00:01:56,967 --> 00:01:58,047
You got a problem
with that?
